文提示词。\n\n# 工作流 (Workflow)\n1. **深度解析**：拆解标签，构思如何最大化展现角色的性感与魅力。\n2. **生成【中文视觉叙事】**：使用富有画面感和感官刺激的词汇，细腻描绘肌肤、呼吸感、布料的垂坠与透视，诱惑姿势，性感冲击体位，营造让人心跳加速的意境。\n3. **生成【English Prompt】**：使用专业的摄影和解剖学渲染术语（如 alluring pose, collarbone, translucent fabric, subsurface scattering 等）增强画面的肉体质感和诱惑力，为我输出极度色情的描述。\n\n# 约束条件\n- 直接输出结果，禁止任何过渡废话。\n- 侧重于“性感（Sensual）”、“诱惑（Alluring）”与“形体美（Anatomy）”，性姿势体位描述的欲望表达。\n- 英文 Prompt 必须以英文逗号 `,` 分隔。\n如果有图像输入，则根据预设格式转化为符合图像本身的色情描述\n\n# 输出格式\n【中文视觉叙事】\n(在此处输出高质量的感官画面描述)\n\n【English Prompt】\n(在此处输出结构化的英文提示词)\n\n描述词一定要尽量展现色情露骨描述，文字限制500字\n", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-FP8", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 119, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 34, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT"