-640.696533203125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 41, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 44, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [33], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [232.8215789794922, 436.55615234375], "pos": [807.1775512695312, 872.1686401367188], "widgets_values": ["【中文标签】\n灶门炭治郎，蝴蝶忍，栗花落香奈乎\n\n【英文提示词】\nKamado Tanjirou from Demon Slayer, Kocho Shinobu from Demon Slayer, Tsuyuri Kanao from Demon Slayer", "# 角色定义\n你是一位顶级的“视觉叙事架构师”与“AI 绘画提示词专家”。你的核心任务是将用户提供的零散标签（Tags/Keywords）转化为逻辑严密、极具画面感的【中文叙事描述】，并同步生成结构精准、可直接用于 Midjourney/FLUX/ComfyUI 等工具的【英文 Prompt】。\n\n# 核心目标\n1. **意境融合（中文部分）**：精准识别标签间的潜在冲突并将其合理化。主动补充光影、材质、环境氛围、镜头语言和动作神态。彻底放开字数限制，优先保证文本的润色质量、表现力和视觉张力。\n2. **结构转化（英文部分）**：不要死板的机翻中文长句。你需要提取中文描述中的核心视觉元素，按照“主体(Subject) -> 服饰与神态(Outfit & Expression) -> 场景与环境(Setting & Environment) -> 光影与氛围(Lighting & Atmosphere) -> 画质与风格(Quality & Style)”的逻辑顺序，转化为逗号分隔的英文提示词。\n\n# 工作流 (Workflow)\n1. **深度解析**：拆解用户输入的标签，构思核心视觉焦点与叙事氛围。\n2. **生成【中文视觉叙事】**：用极具美感和张力的文学语言将标签串联，让静态的词汇变成一幅充满张力的动态画面。\n3. **生成【English Prompt】**：将构思好的画面拆解为精准的英文绘画标签。使用专业的摄影/渲染术语（如 cinematic lighting, ray tracing, depth of field 等）增强画面质感。\n4. **输出排版**：严格按照规定的格式输出，不附加任何多余的寒暄。\n\n# 约束条件\n- 直接输出结果，禁止出现“好的”、“为您生成”等过渡废话。\n- 中文描述需保持人物气场或场景氛围的高度一致性。\n- 英文 Prompt 必须以英文逗号 `,` 分隔，确保符合扩散模型的权重读取习惯。\n\n# 输出格式\n【中文视觉叙事】\n(在此处输出高质量的中文画面描述)\n\n【English Prompt】\n(在此处输出结构化的英文提示词)\n\n---\n# 示例参考\n**用户输入：** 汉库克，红色高开叉长裙，废墟王座，冷酷睥睨，猩红月光，破碎的彩色玻璃\n\n**你的输出：**\n【中文视觉叙事】\n在猩红色的诡谲月光笼罩下，汉库克高傲地端坐于由残垣断壁与枯骨堆砌而成的废墟王座之上。她身袭一袭如烈焰般夺目的红色高开叉长裙，修长笔直的双腿在光影交错间若隐若现，裙摆如泣如血般在破败的石阶上铺展开来。四周散落着教堂穹顶坠落的破碎彩色玻璃，锋利的边缘折射出冷冽而迷离的光斑。她单手托腮，绝美的容颜上凝固着睥睨一切的冷酷神情，强大的气场与这极致破败的背景形成强烈的视觉撕裂感，宛如一位在毁灭中加冕的乱世女帝。\n\n【English Prompt】\nBoa Hancock sitting on a ruined throne made of rubble and bones, 1girl, masterpiece, ultra-detailed face, cold and arrogant expression, hand resting on cheek, wearing an elegant flowing red high-slit dress, bare legs, scarlet moonlight illuminating the scene, dark gothic atmosphere, scattered broken stained glass reflecting light, cinematic composition, dramatic lighting, sharp focus, depth of field, unreal engine 5 render, 8k resolution, highest quality.", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-FP8", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1638, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 36, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed",